# =============================================================================
# Megamall Anomaly (Godot 4.7 Vulkan) — .gitignore
# =============================================================================

# 1. Local AI Chat Logs & Session Databases (Keep locally on disk, never in Git)
AntigravityChatHistory/

# 2. Godot 4 Local Editor & Import Cache (Auto-generated by Godot)
.godot/
*.translation

# 3. Exported Game Builds & Release Archives (Upload to GitHub Releases instead)
Builds/
*.pck
*.apk

# 4. Large Whisper Speech Model Binary (466 MB — exceeds GitHub's 100 MB limit)
#    Fetch on demand via: ./Scripts/fetch_whisper_model.sh (Linux)
#    or: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File Automation/Voice/prepare_whisper.ps1 (Windows)
ThirdParty/Whisper/Models/*.bin
VoiceModels/Vosk/Whisper/*.bin

# 5. Redundant Raw Archive Duplicates (Already extracted in VoiceModels/ & ThirdParty/)
ExternalAssets/Voice/Extracted/
ExternalAssets/Voice/*.zip
ExternalAssets/Mall/Surfaces/texturecan_tiles_0013/*.zip

# 6. Python / OS Temporary Files
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
